":"Faruzan","r":[0.1222,0.717,0.0333,0.0267]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.163,0.717,0.0333,0.0267]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2037,0.717,0.0333,0.0267]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/xiao/261111-225405/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","text":"High base ATK, CRIT Rate, and stacking ATK/DMG buffs suit Xiao’s sustained on-field plunges. Build stacks by hitting enemies."},{"name":"Staff of Homa","text":"Huge CRIT DMG and HP-based ATK make this an excellent premium alternative, even above half HP. Do not sacrifice healing to force the low-HP bonus."},{"name":"Lumidouce Elegy","text":"High CRIT Rate and ATK-oriented stats make a strong premium stat stick; much of its passive is irrelevant to Xiao. Avoid overcapping CRIT Rate with Marechaussee Hunter."},{"name":"Calamity Queller","text":"High base ATK and Elemental DMG Bonus help Xiao, although its off-field-oriented passive is not fully utilized. Best if ATK buffs are limited."},{"name":"Vortex Vanquisher","text":"Large ATK gains can work with a shield, but it offers no CRIT and its shield-strength bonus applies to Xiao only. Requires reliable shielding to exploit its ATK passive."},{"name":"Deathmatch","text":"Its CRIT Rate makes Xiao easier to build, and its situational ATK passive works in both single-target and AoE fights. Avoid excess CRIT Rate on Marechaussee Hunter."},{"name":"Lithic Spear","text":"ATK% and Liyue-party stacks can give strong value in compatible teams, especially at higher refinements. Requires Liyue teammates for its passive. Higher refinements improve performance."},{"name":"Missive Windspear","text":"An accessible ATK% option; its reaction-triggered ATK buff is situational, and EM contributes little to standard Xiao damage. Event-only; passive depends on triggering a reaction."}],"a":[{"names":["Vermillion Hereafter"],"text":"Burst HP drain quickly stacks up to 48% extra ATK at four stacks; reliable across long plunging rotations, especially in AoE.","stats":"ATK% · Anemo DMG/ATK% · CRIT"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Burst HP drain activates up to 36% CRIT Rate. Excellent with Xianyun/Furina; avoid overcapping CRIT Rate.","stats":"ATK% · Anemo DMG/ATK% · CRIT"},{"names":["Long Night's Oath"],"text":"Greatly boosts Plunging Attack DMG through successive plunges. Strong with Bennett; requires consistent plunge timing.","stats":"ATK% · Anemo DMG · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Adeptal Air Force","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Xianyun","Furina"],"text":"Premium plunge hypercarry: Faruzan shreds Anemo RES, Xianyun boosts plunges and heals, and Furina adds damage buffs.","roles":["Main DPS","Anemo Buffer","Healer / Buffer","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Lament on Repeat","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Zhongli","Bennett"],"text":"A classic Xiao hypercarry. Faruzan boosts Anemo, Zhongli protects and shreds RES, and Bennett grants major ATK buffs.","roles":["Main DPS","Anemo Buffer","Shielder","ATK Buffer / Healer"]},{"name":"Windborne Remedy","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Jean","Furina"],"text":"Faruzan buffs Anemo damage, Jean heals and batteries Xiao, and Furina provides off-field damage and Fanfare buffs.","roles":["Main DPS","Anemo Buffer","Healer / Battery","Sub DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Budget Yaksha","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Sucrose","Bennett"],"text":"A lower-cost triple-Anemo core: Faruzan buffs Xiao, Sucrose funnels particles, and Bennett heals and boosts ATK.","roles":["Main DPS","Anemo Buffer","Anemo Battery","ATK Buffer / Healer"]}],"v":"Xianyun/Furina: Marechaussee Hunter gains 36% CRIT Rate from HP changes; reduce displayed CRIT Rate and favor CRIT DMG.\nBennett Plunges: Long Night's Oath excels with steady plunge timing and Bennett ATK buffs; Anemo DMG Goblet favored.\nHigh AoE: Vermillion Hereafter provides reliable ATK during HP-draining Burst rotations, especially against multiple enemies.\nAccessible Xiao: Deathmatch or Missive Windspear, with Sucrose battery and a healer; prioritize enough ER for every Burst.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Xiao is an on-field Anemo hypercarry who converts his attacks to Anemo during Burst and delivers powerful Plunging Attacks. His Burst drains HP, making healing and Anemo energy support valuable. Build CRIT, ATK, and enough Energy Recharge to Burst every rotation.","pros":["Strong AoE plunges","Excellent Anemo hypercarry","Powerful premium supports","Flexible weapon options"],"cons":["Burst-dependent damage","Needs energy support","Drains own HP","Limited off-field value"],"weapons":["Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","Staff of Homa","Lumidouce Elegy","Calamity Queller","Vortex Vanquisher","Deathmatch","Lithic Spear","Missive Windspear"],"arts":[{"sets":["Vermillion Hereafter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Long Night's Oath"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ATK%","Anemo DMG Bonus / ATK%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["CRIT Rate: 70% - 85% (Non-MH)","CRIT DMG: 150% - 220%+","Energy Recharge: 110% - 140%+","ATK: 1,800 - 2,400+","MH CRIT Rate: 45% - 64% shown"],"vars":[{"title":"FFXX Premium Plunge","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","Staff of Homa","Deathmatch"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Vermillion Hereafter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Aim for 45–64% displayed CRIT Rate on Marechaussee; invest the rest in CRIT DMG, ATK and sufficient ER.","teams":"Xianyun, Furina and ideally C6 Faruzan.","when":"Best for maximum single-target plunge damage and mobile buffs. Xianyun heals through Xiao’s HP drain.","cond":"CRIT Rate cap includes Marechaussee 36%.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Bennett Plunge Hypercarry","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","Staff of Homa","Calamity Queller"],"arts":[{"sets":["Long Night's Oath"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Vermillion Hereafter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Anemo DMG Goblet and strong CRIT rolls; ensure Burst uptime before stacking more ATK.","teams":"Bennett and Faruzan; add shielding or an Anemo battery.","when":"Use when playing inside Bennett’s field and maintaining consecutive high plunges.","cond":"Long Night’s Oath loses stacks when plunge timing is interrupted.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Classic AoE Vermillion","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","Staff of Homa","Vortex Vanquisher"],"arts":[{"sets":["Vermillion Hereafter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance 70%+ CRIT Rate, CRIT DMG, and ATK; 110–140%+ ER depending on batteries.","teams":"Faruzan plus sustain and an Anemo energy source.","when":"Reliable general-purpose Xiao for grouped enemies and prolonged Burst rotations.","cond":"Use Skill charges before Burst to pre-funnel particles.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Accessible Battery Team","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Deathmatch","Lithic Spear","Missive Windspear"],"arts":[{"sets":["Vermillion Hereafter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER can rise above 140% without C6 Faruzan; maintain CRIT balance and use ATK% Sands.","teams":"Sucrose or other Anemo battery, Bennett and a healer/shielder.","when":"For players without premium supports or weapons. Consistent Burst uptime outweighs occasional larger plunges.","cond":"Lithic Spear needs Liyue teammates for stronger passive.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Juvenile Jade","Teachings of Prosperity","Guide to Prosperity","Philosophies of Prosperity","Slime Condensate","Slime Secretions","Slime Concentrate","Qingxin","Shadow of the Warrior","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 8-9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6-8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Adeptal Air Force","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Xianyun","Furina"]},{"name":"Lament on Repeat","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Zhongli","Bennett"]},{"name":"Windborne Remedy","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Jean","Furina"]},{"name":"Budget Yaksha","members":["Xiao","Faruzan","Sucrose","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Xiao","el":"Anemo"}